    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24144" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-tentātus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>untouched.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vacca intentata jugo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen.
					Med. 62</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>untried</i>, <i>unattempted</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">miseri, quibus Intentata nites,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 1, 5, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nil intentatum nostri liquere poëtae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					P. 285</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sors rerum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 10, 39</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">iter,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					1, 50</span></i>
			.</div>
